OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fthis evening will quickly fade,
OL,7,Fleading to a clear and dry night.
OL,8,FUnder the clear skies it will feel
OL,9,Fcooler than last night with a few mist
OL,10,Fand fog patches developing. Winds
OL,11,Feasing overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAn increasingly breezy day
OL,14,Fon Wednesday as a strengthening
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly wind develops.
OL,16,FOtherwise, long sunny spells in the
OL,17,Fmorning, then more limited in the
OL,18,Fafternoon. Another mild day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
