OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBreezy on Thursday with increasing
OL,7,Fcloud. Rain overnight into Friday but
OL,8,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells during
OL,9,Fthe day. Cooler on Saturday with light
OL,10,Fwinds and sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
